<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.source.reconciles ~ re-settle a sensorium against its source

`name` names one sensorium; `all` re-settles every one.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///sense.source.reconciles", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ name · all

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/word ~ the sensorium by name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`all` params=`~ every one`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///sense.source.reconciles

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///sense.source.reconciles]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

